---
output: svg
---
@startuml x
' Regression test: a $tag directly on a transition (e.g. "A --> B $tag")
' attaches the tag to the Link itself, not to either endpoint state. This is
' what lets a single branch out of a *shared* pseudostate be scoped to one
' scenario without removing the pseudostate (which would take every sibling
' branch with it) or the target state (which may be shared context too).
state PickProfile <<choice>>
state ChargeSessionA
state ChargeSessionB
state ChargeSessionC

PickProfile --> ChargeSessionA $s01
PickProfile --> ChargeSessionB
PickProfile --> ChargeSessionC

remove $s01
@enduml
